{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"catppuccin-mocha-like","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Mocha Latte Dark","description":"Soft pastel colors on a warm dark base.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Mocha Latte Dark","path":"themes/catppuccin-mocha-like.json","uiTheme":"dark"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/catppuccin-mocha-like.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Mocha Latte Dark\",\n  \"type\": \"dark\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#1e1e2e\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#cdd6f4\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#181825\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#11111b\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#11111b\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#181825\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#313244\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#45475a\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#313244\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#181825\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#11111b\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#cba6f7\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#cba6f7\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#cba6f7\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#45475a\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#31324480\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#cba6f7\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#11111b\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#f38ba8\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#a6e3a1\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#f9e2af\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#f38ba8\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#6c7086\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#a6e3a1\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#fab387\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#cba6f7\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f9e2af\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#89b4fa\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#fab387\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#89dceb\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f38ba8\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f9e2af\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f5c2e7\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Mocha Latte Dark\n\nSoft pastel colors on a warm dark base.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Mocha Latte Dark** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a dark theme.\n\nColors from the Catppuccin Mocha palette (MIT).\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#1e1e2e` |\n| Text | `#cdd6f4` |\n| Accent | `#cba6f7` |\n| Keywords | `#cba6f7` |\n| Strings | `#a6e3a1` |\n| Functions | `#89b4fa` |\n| Types | `#f9e2af` |\n| Comments | `#6c7086` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}